<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>四类决策把「取舍」写进模型，完成是约束、成本是目标</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>01 任务分配 · 问题与决策</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>选择性 y 与异巢起降联合精确决策，是与既有问题定义的两个分野。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 620, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>单周期四类决策</Text><Box style={{width: 620, gap: 2}}><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#1E4FA8', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>决策</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>含义</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 230, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>取值与耦合</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>y_j</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>是否执行</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 230, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>0 / 1，允许 y_j = 0（选择性）</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>x_uj</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>UAV–任务归属</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 230, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>Σ_u x_uj = y_j，一任务至多一机</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>π_u</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>访问顺序</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 230, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务序列，允许空序列（空闲合法）</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 620, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 150, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>z_ub</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 240, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>终点机巢</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 230, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>容量约束下与全机队联合择优</Text></Box></Box></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>硬约束：航程 / 飞行时间 / 时序 / 同步 / 机巢容量 / 终点可达 / 结构</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>软约束：时间窗迟到——迟到不是废飞，仍计完成、计全额奖励</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 15, gap: 11}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>目标口径：完成是约束，成本是目标</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>F1 = Σ_j R_j·y_j　只作事后统计指标</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>min F2 = C_path(x, π, z, y)　含返航的三维航程总和</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>已选且可装的任务必须全部交付：由覆盖门禁构造性强制。合法解的完成量恒相同，F1 对解没有区分度，不进搜索适应度。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>关键更正：当前实现不采用「以交付收益最大化为第一目标的字典序」，也不采用 big-M 把完成数写进目标；lexicographic 等开关名是历史命名，F3 已整体移除。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>分层动机：y × x × π × z 的组合规模随 N! 与 B 的 U 次方增长，DEM 三维代价查询昂贵，单周期内全要素联合精确解不可达。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 进展汇报（合并版）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>11 / 29</Text></Box></Slide>